1. Definitions. - In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires, -
(a)
'Old Panchayats Act' means the Andhra Pradesh Gram Panchayat Act, 1964;
(b)
'Panchayat' means a panchayat constituted under the old Panchayats Act;
(c)
'Member' means a member of a panchayat constituted under the Old Panchayats Act;
(d)
'Sarpanch' means a Sarpanch of a Gram Panchayat constituted under the Old Panchayats Act.
